  message: "emission-parity:F1 / G2 gate finding (PR #4202, LIVE dataclasses): Symbol.is_exported IS populated by the analyzers — 3/N True for ALL 8 mainstream langs. The is_exported-None-100pct reading was a SERIALIZED-JSON probe artifact: the field is relocated to supply_chain.is_exported on serialization (cli.py / ir.py from_dict). So this is NOT an analyzer-emission gap — the is_exported gate cell is a hard lock (green) for every language. Reframes WI-bujot from analyzer-never-populates to the two-writer / serialization-relocation concern, which remains open. Closing WI-bujot on this basis would require citing the relocation code paths, not just the live-field lock."  # 029c
